vehicle.description:
Feed: {feed_id}

Choose this vehicle's device ({count} found in the last 30 days of the feed and in the archive that are not set up yet), or type its ID if the feed has been quiet: the messenger ID for SPOT, or the IMEI for Garmin. Add the feed again for each other device.

Leave the name empty to use the name the service reports, and the icon empty for the default.

init.description:
Feed ID: {feed_id}

Device ID: {device_id}

Stored positions: {message_count}

First archived position: {first_position}

Latest archived position: {latest_position}

Latest coordinates (latitude, longitude): {coordinates}

Leave the name empty to use {default_name}, and the icon empty for the default. To stop the tracker but keep collecting positions and map history, disable the tracker entity. For entity ID, area, labels, visibility and voice assistant settings, open the tracker under Settings → Devices & services → Entities.
